      "content": "It sounds like you're experiencing a form of burnout or what some call \"achievement fatigue,\" which is completely understandable after such intense dedication. Often, the goal you chased changes once you actually attain it, leading to a sense of emptiness. Perhaps it's time to explore redefining success outside of just the title or external milestones you set for yourself. Consider what truly brings you intrinsic joy now that the pursuit is over.",
